# Implementation Plan - FixNest Frontend

Generate a complete, production-ready frontend for a Trello-style SaaS using Next.js 14, TailwindCSS, ShadCN UI, Zustand, and DnD Kit.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> The project will be initialized in `d:\Fixnest\fixnest\frontend`.
> I will use `npm` for dependency management as requested.

